---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Constitution">
  <div class="mb-8">
    <div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-amber-500/20">
      <div class="hero-gradient absolute inset-0 animate-gradient"></div>
      <div class="relative z-10 p-8">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-2">
          <div class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-400 to-orange-500 text-lg font-bold text-white shadow-lg shadow-amber-500/20">📜</div>
          <div>
            <h1 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight">
              <span class="gradient-text">League Constitution</span>
            </h1>
            <p class="text-zinc-400 text-sm mt-0.5">TINEZ LEAGUE · Official Rules & Bylaws · Established 2014</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Quick Links -->
  <div class="flex gap-2 mb-6 overflow-x-auto pb-2">
    <a href="#overview" class="flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg bg-zinc-800/50 px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-medium text-zinc-400 hover:text-zinc-200 border border-zinc-700/30 transition-all">Overview</a>
    <a href="#scoring" class="flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg bg-zinc-800/50 px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-medium text-zinc-400 hover:text-zinc-200 border border-zinc-700/30 transition-all">Scoring</a>
    <a href="#rosters" class="flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg bg-zinc-800/50 px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-medium text-zinc-400 hover:text-zinc-200 border border-zinc-700/30 transition-all">Rosters</a>
    <a href="#draft" class="flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg bg-zinc-800/50 px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-medium text-zinc-400 hover:text-zinc-200 border border-zinc-700/30 transition-all">Draft</a>
    <a href="#keepers" class="flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg bg-zinc-800/50 px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-medium text-zinc-400 hover:text-zinc-200 border border-zinc-700/30 transition-all">Keepers</a>
    <a href="#playoffs" class="flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg bg-zinc-800/50 px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-medium text-zinc-400 hover:text-zinc-200 border border-zinc-700/30 transition-all">Playoffs</a>
    <a href="#finances" class="flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg bg-zinc-800/50 px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-medium text-zinc-400 hover:text-zinc-200 border border-zinc-700/30 transition-all">Finances</a>
    <a href="#conduct" class="flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg bg-zinc-800/50 px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-medium text-zinc-400 hover:text-zinc-200 border border-zinc-700/30 transition-all">Conduct</a>
    <a href="#punishment" class="flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg bg-zinc-800/50 px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-medium text-zinc-400 hover:text-zinc-200 border border-zinc-700/30 transition-all">Punishment</a>
    <a href="#champions" class="flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg bg-zinc-800/50 px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-medium text-zinc-400 hover:text-zinc-200 border border-zinc-700/30 transition-all">Champions</a>
    <a href="#resources" class="flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg bg-zinc-800/50 px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-medium text-zinc-400 hover:text-zinc-200 border border-zinc-700/30 transition-all">Resources</a>
  </div>

  <!-- Overview -->
  <div id="overview" class="glass-card rounded-xl p-6 mb-6">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-4">
      <span class="text-lg">📋</span>
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-amber-400">1. League Overview</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="space-y-3 text-sm text-zinc-400">
      <p><strong class="text-zinc-200">League Name:</strong> TINEZ LEAGUE</p>
      <p><strong class="text-zinc-200">Established:</strong> 2014</p>
      <p><strong class="text-zinc-200">Commissioner:</strong> Carlos Cabrales III (Carlitos)</p>
      <p><strong class="text-zinc-200">Commissioner Contact:</strong> (209) 423-6633 · carloscbrls@gmail.com</p>
      <p><strong class="text-zinc-200">Co-Commissioners:</strong> Joshua Phillips ((858) 382-6412) · Darnell Simmons ((669) 207-9577)</p>
      <p><strong class="text-zinc-200">Treasurer:</strong> Joshua Phillips</p>
      <p><strong class="text-zinc-200">Number of Teams:</strong> 14</p>
      <p><strong class="text-zinc-200">Platform:</strong> Yahoo Fantasy Sports (League ID 541137)</p>
      <p><strong class="text-zinc-200">Scoring Type:</strong> Head-to-Head</p>
      <p><strong class="text-zinc-200">Format:</strong> 0.5 PPR · IDP · 6pt Passing TD</p>
      <p><strong class="text-zinc-200">Governance:</strong> Three-commissioner system for balance, accountability, and fairness</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Scoring -->
  <div id="scoring" class="glass-card rounded-xl p-6 mb-6">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-4">
      <span class="text-lg">📊</span>
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-amber-400">2. Scoring Rules</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="space-y-4">
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-zinc-200 mb-2">Offensive Scoring</h3>
        <div class="bg-zinc-800/30 rounded-lg p-3">
          <table class="w-full text-xs">
            <thead>
              <tr class="text-zinc-500">
                <th class="text-left pb-1">Category</th>
                <th class="text-right pb-1">Points</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody class="text-zinc-400">
              <tr><td class="py-0.5">Passing TD</td><td class="text-right font-mono text-emerald-400">6</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="py-0.5">Passing Yard</td><td class="text-right font-mono">25 yds/pt</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="py-0.5">Interception</td><td class="text-right font-mono text-red-400">-3</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="py-0.5">Rushing/Receiving TD</td><td class="text-right font-mono text-emerald-400">6</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="py-0.5">Rushing/Receiving Yard</td><td class="text-right font-mono">10 yds/pt</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="py-0.5">Reception</td><td class="text-right font-mono text-emerald-400">0.5</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="py-0.5">2-Point Conversion</td><td class="text-right font-mono">2</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="py-0.5">Fumble Lost</td><td class="text-right font-mono text-red-400">-2</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="py-0.5">Sack (QB)</td><td class="text-right font-mono text-red-400">-2</td></tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-zinc-200 mb-2">IDP Scoring</h3>
        <div class="bg-zinc-800/30 rounded-lg p-3">
          <table class="w-full text-xs">
            <thead>
              <tr class="text-zinc-500">
                <th class="text-left pb-1">Category</th>
                <th class="text-right pb-1">Points</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody class="text-zinc-400">
              <tr><td class="py-0.5">Solo Tackle</td><td class="text-right font-mono text-emerald-400">1.5</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="py-0.5">Assisted Tackle</td><td class="text-right font-mono">0.5</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="py-0.5">Sack</td><td class="text-right font-mono text-emerald-400">3</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="py-0.5">Interception</td><td class="text-right font-mono text-emerald-400">3</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="py-0.5">Forced Fumble</td><td class="text-right font-mono">2</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="py-0.5">Fumble Recovery</td><td class="text-right font-mono">2</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="py-0.5">Pass Defensed</td><td class="text-right font-mono">1</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="py-0.5">Tackle for Loss</td><td class="text-right font-mono">0.5</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="py-0.5">Blocked Kick</td><td class="text-right font-mono">3</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="py-0.5">Safety</td><td class="text-right font-mono">2</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="py-0.5">Defensive TD</td><td class="text-right font-mono text-emerald-400">6</td></tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-zinc-200 mb-2">Kicking & Special Teams</h3>
        <div class="bg-zinc-800/30 rounded-lg p-3">
          <table class="w-full text-xs">
            <thead>
              <tr class="text-zinc-500">
                <th class="text-left pb-1">Category</th>
                <th class="text-right pb-1">Points</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody class="text-zinc-400">
              <tr><td class="py-0.5">Field Goal 0-39 yds</td><td class="text-right font-mono">3</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="py-0.5">Field Goal 40-49 yds</td><td class="text-right font-mono">4</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="py-0.5">Field Goal 50+ yds</td><td class="text-right font-mono">5</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="py-0.5">Extra Point</td><td class="text-right font-mono">1</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="py-0.5">Extra Point Returned</td><td class="text-right font-mono text-emerald-400">6</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="py-0.5">Return Yards</td><td class="text-right font-mono">25 yds/pt</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="py-0.5">Return TD</td><td class="text-right font-mono text-emerald-400">6</td></tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Rosters -->
  <div id="rosters" class="glass-card rounded-xl p-6 mb-6">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-4">
      <span class="text-lg">👥</span>
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-amber-400">3. Roster Rules</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="space-y-3 text-sm text-zinc-400">
      <p><strong class="text-zinc-200">Starting Offense:</strong> 1 QB, 3 WR, 2 RB, 1 TE, 1 Flex (W/R/T), 1 K</p>
      <p><strong class="text-zinc-200">Starting IDP:</strong> 2 DL, 2 LB, 2 DB, 1 Any DP</p>
      <p><strong class="text-zinc-200">Bench:</strong> 6 spots</p>
      <p><strong class="text-zinc-200">IR Spots:</strong> 3</p>
      <p><strong class="text-zinc-200">Position Limits:</strong> None</p>
      <p><strong class="text-zinc-200">Waiver Type:</strong> Free Agency only (no waivers)</p>
      <p><strong class="text-zinc-200">Max Transactions (Season):</strong> 50</p>
      <p><strong class="text-zinc-200">Trade Deadline:</strong> Week 10</p>
      <p><strong class="text-zinc-200">Trade Acceptance:</strong> Must be accepted 24 hours before kickoff</p>
      <p><strong class="text-zinc-200">Trade Review:</strong> League votes</p>
      <p><strong class="text-zinc-200">Roster Oversight:</strong> Empty roster spots filled with lowest-projected bench player</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Draft -->
  <div id="draft" class="glass-card rounded-xl p-6 mb-6">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-4">
      <span class="text-lg">📋</span>
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-amber-400">4. Draft Rules</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="space-y-3 text-sm text-zinc-400">
      <p><strong class="text-zinc-200">Draft Type:</strong> Offline draft (Random Generator order)</p>
      <p><strong class="text-zinc-200">Draft Order:</strong> Finalized 3-7 days before the draft (League vote on method)</p>
      <p><strong class="text-zinc-200">Draft Day Theme:</strong> Champion chooses the theme</p>
      <p><strong class="text-zinc-200">Draft Stream:</strong> Live-streamed on YouTube</p>
      <p><strong class="text-zinc-200">Keeper Declaration:</strong> 24 hours before draft</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Keepers -->
  <div id="keepers" class="glass-card rounded-xl p-6 mb-6">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-4">
      <span class="text-lg">🔄</span>
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-amber-400">5. Keeper Rules</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="space-y-3 text-sm text-zinc-400">
      <p><strong class="text-zinc-200">Format:</strong> 1 offensive + 1 defensive keeper allowed</p>
      <p><strong class="text-zinc-200">Eligibility:</strong> Must be rostered by Week 8</p>
      <p><strong class="text-zinc-200">Keep Length:</strong> Can only be kept for 1 season</p>
      <p><strong class="text-zinc-200">Declaration:</strong> Keepers must be declared 24 hours before the draft</p>
      <p><strong class="text-zinc-200">Restriction:</strong> No player listed in last year's draft board (Rounds 21 &amp; 22) may be kept again</p>
      <p><strong class="text-zinc-200">New Team Owners:</strong> May keep anyone on their roster, including players kept previously by former owners</p>
      <p><strong class="text-zinc-200">Article XXI:</strong> The "--empty--" draft slot from last year's draft (Round 21) is officially Aaron Donald</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Playoffs -->
  <div id="playoffs" class="glass-card rounded-xl p-6 mb-6">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-4">
      <span class="text-lg">🏆</span>
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-amber-400">6. Playoff Rules</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="space-y-3 text-sm text-zinc-400">
      <p><strong class="text-zinc-200">Teams:</strong> 8 teams qualify (playoff bracket)</p>
      <p><strong class="text-zinc-200">Format:</strong> 8-team bracket, Weeks 15-17</p>
      <p><strong class="text-zinc-200">Tiebreakers:</strong> Win % → Points For → Head-to-Head → Coin Flip</p>
      <p><strong class="text-zinc-200">Non-Playoff Teams:</strong> Locked after Week 14</p>
      <p><strong class="text-zinc-200">Consolation:</strong> Non-playoff teams play for draft position</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Finances -->
  <div id="finances" class="glass-card rounded-xl p-6 mb-6">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-4">
      <span class="text-lg">💰</span>
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-amber-400">7. Financial Rules</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="space-y-3 text-sm text-zinc-400">
      <p><strong class="text-zinc-200">Buy-In:</strong> $175 per team per season (14 teams)</p>
      <p><strong class="text-zinc-200">Total Pool:</strong> $2,450</p>
      <p><strong class="text-zinc-200">Yahoo Prize Pool:</strong> $1,400</p>
      <p><strong class="text-zinc-200">Venmo / Apple Pay Bonus Pool:</strong> $840</p>
      <p><strong class="text-zinc-200">1st Place:</strong> $1,435</p>
      <p><strong class="text-zinc-200">2nd Place:</strong> $175</p>
      <p><strong class="text-zinc-200">Weekly Winners:</strong> $30 each (Weeks 11-14)</p>
      <p><strong class="text-zinc-200">Payment Due:</strong> $175 via Venmo / Apple Pay to Treasurer by Week 10</p>
      <p><strong class="text-zinc-200">Late Payment:</strong> Team is ineligible to draft until dues are paid</p>
      <p><strong class="text-zinc-200">Prize Pool Adjustment:</strong> If league size changes, payouts scale proportionally</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Conduct -->
  <div id="conduct" class="glass-card rounded-xl p-6 mb-6">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-4">
      <span class="text-lg">⚖️</span>
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-amber-400">8. League Conduct</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="space-y-3 text-sm text-zinc-400">
      <p><strong class="text-zinc-200">Collusion:</strong> Zero tolerance. Any team found colluding will be expelled from the league.</p>
      <p><strong class="text-zinc-200">Tanking:</strong> Intentional tanking for better draft position is prohibited.</p>
      <p><strong class="text-zinc-200">Inactive Teams:</strong> Teams that fail to set lineups for 3 consecutive weeks may be removed.</p>
      <p><strong class="text-zinc-200">Trash Talk:</strong> Encouraged. If you dish it, you must be able to take it.</p>
      <p><strong class="text-zinc-200">Rule Changes — Preseason:</strong> Requires 2/3 majority</p>
      <p><strong class="text-zinc-200">Rule Changes — Midseason:</strong> Requires unanimous approval</p>
      <p><strong class="text-zinc-200">Commissioner Authority:</strong> Three-commissioner system; Commissioner has final say, appeals go to the league.</p>
      <p><strong class="text-zinc-200">Communication:</strong> All announcements posted in Yahoo Chat or group text are binding once posted.</p>
      <p><strong class="text-zinc-200">Punishment:</strong> Last place must complete league-assigned punishment before next year's draft or forfeit league membership.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Last Place Punishment -->
  <div id="punishment" class="glass-card rounded-xl p-6 mb-6">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-4">
      <span class="text-lg">🍳</span>
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-amber-400">9. Last Place Punishment</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="space-y-3 text-sm text-zinc-400">
      <p><strong class="text-zinc-200">Default:</strong> Waffle Challenge — 24 hours in a diner, minus 2 hours per waffle/pancake consumed.</p>
      <p><strong class="text-zinc-200">Alternative Options:</strong></p>
      <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1">
        <li>$300 Fine</li>
        <li>Golden Toilet Trophy</li>
        <li>Funny League Video</li>
        <li>Draft Penalty (last pick, Round 1)</li>
        <li>Extra $50 on next year's buy-in</li>
      </ul>
      <p><strong class="text-zinc-200">Refusal:</strong> $300 fine + next year's fee upfront OR removal from league.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Hall of Champions -->
  <div id="champions" class="glass-card rounded-xl p-6 mb-6">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-4">
      <span class="text-lg">🏆</span>
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-amber-400">10. Hall of Champions</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="space-y-3 text-sm text-zinc-400">
      <p><strong class="text-zinc-200">2023:</strong> DatDudeVic 🏆</p>
      <p><strong class="text-zinc-200">2025:</strong> DatDudeVic 🏆</p>
      <p><strong class="text-zinc-200">2026:</strong> jayyphilly 🏆</p>
      <p class="pt-2 text-xs text-amber-400/70">Dynasty Recognition: Winning 3+ titles in a row = permanent enshrinement.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- New Manager Resource Guide -->
  <div id="resources" class="glass-card rounded-xl p-6 mb-6">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-4">
      <span class="text-lg">📚</span>
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-amber-400">11. Resource Guide for New Managers</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="space-y-4 text-sm text-zinc-400">
      <p class="text-xs text-zinc-500">Welcome to fantasy football! Since this is a 14-team Half-PPR Yahoo league, here are the most relevant resources:</p>
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-zinc-200 mb-1">1. Understanding Half-PPR</h3>
        <p>Yahoo Fantasy Football Scoring Help. Key takeaway: WRs and pass-catching RBs gain more value in this format.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-zinc-200 mb-1">2. Draft &amp; Rankings Help</h3>
        <p>Yahoo Pre-Draft Rankings &amp; ADP (via league draft room) · CBS Fantasy Football Today Podcast · Fantasy Footballers (Foot Clan) · The Ringer Fantasy Football Show</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-zinc-200 mb-1">3. Weekly Lineup Help</h3>
        <p>Yahoo Fantasy App — “Who Should I Start?” Tool · FantasyPros Start/Sit Assistant</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-zinc-200 mb-1">4. Position Tips in Half-PPR</h3>
        <p>QB – Only need 1; plenty of mid-round value. RB – Pass-catching RBs are gold. WR – Most valuable position in Half-PPR. TE – Only a few elite; otherwise stream weekly. K/DEF – Always draft last; stream matchups.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-zinc-200 mb-1">5. Waiver Wire Help</h3>
        <p>FantasyPros Waiver Rankings · Yahoo Waiver Wire Articles (inside the app weekly)</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-zinc-200 mb-1">6. Trade Analyzer</h3>
        <p>FantasyPros Trade Analyzer · Yahoo’s in-app trade comparison tool</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-zinc-200 mb-1">7. News &amp; Injury Updates</h3>
        <p>NBC Sports Edge Player News · Yahoo Player Cards (tap a player’s name for live news/injuries)</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-zinc-200 mb-1">8. For Beginners</h3>
        <p>Fantasy Football 101 – NFL Guide · FantasyPros Glossary</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-zinc-200 mb-1">9. Office-Friendly Podcasts</h3>
        <p>Yahoo Fantasy Football Forecast · CBS Fantasy Football Today · The Ringer Fantasy Football Show</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-zinc-200 mb-1">10. IDP (New Teams)</h3>
        <p>New teams who haven't done IDP: review IDP Top Players and defensive scoring guide.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Last Updated -->
  <div class="text-center text-xs text-zinc-600 mt-8">
    Last updated: 2026 Season · Questions? Contact the Commissioner
  </div>
</Layout>
